# MCP and agent access

An MCP integration can make trace context available to an engineering assistant during investigation. Scope credentials to the project and expose read operations before enabling actions that change prompts, evaluations, or release state.

Keep the same boundaries as the dashboard: redact secrets, limit result size, and preserve project permissions. The assistant should point to the run, span, prompt version, or score that supports its conclusion.
